  605:   /// Turns the downloaded streams into one complete video file in the export
  606:   /// directory. Returns the file (null on failure) and the stream files the
  607:   /// caller removes once completion is saved. On failure the stream files
  608:   /// are kept, so the entry still plays in-app as before.
  609:   Future<({String? output, List<String> inputs})> _mergeDownload(
  610:     BiliDownloadEntryInfo entry,
  611:   ) async {
